== Trivia ==
*The possible Rabbit names are comparable to the names of the [[Chocolate Rabbits]].
**Specifically, 365 names are shared between the two.
**4 names are unique to '''Cowboy Nick'''. (Appollo, Bubles, Dutchess and Lilly){{sic}}
**Rest are unique to Hoppity's Collection.

